<p>Hits the target doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">85%, 92%, 97%, 101%, 105%</acronym> weapon damage. If the attack hits, you pull the target in and strike them again, dealing another <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">115%, 122%, 127%, 131%, 135%</acronym> weapon damage.</p>